%li.jpost#software
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.icon-plus
    %h3.name Software Engineer

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        Mountain View, CA, or Singapore

      %p Nitrous.IO software engineers are responsible for driving the user experience and performance of our web and desktop applications.
      %p We&rsquo;re looking for motivated, independent thinkers who employ creative, scalable and performant solutions.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Build new features in Ruby, Node.js, and Ember.js
          %li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

      %h4 Technologies
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Ruby on Rails, Python, Node.js, Go
          %li jQuery, Ember.js
          %li PostgreSQL, Redis, Memcache
          %li Websockets
          %li Amazon Web Services
          %li RabbitMQ, AMQP
          %li Git

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li A passion for cloud computing and optimization
          %li Obsessive attention to detail
          %li Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of what’s possible
          %li Degree in Computer Science or related technical field

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Resume
            %li Github Profile
            %li Links to side/hobby projects that you have built

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Software%20Engineer', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
